(6629868, 989382, 88235, '<td valign="top">very 1960''s... nicely done.</td>', 'very 1960''s... nicely done.', '2012-01-01 10:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6629869, 988206, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Very put-on-the-wall-able; a victory of texture and colour over form and authentic reproduction. Great colours and enough tree detail to allow the brain to anchor its appreciation. I love that focal square too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Can''t think of anything I would change.<br/> <br/>Overall: A fine semi-abstract.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Very put-on-the-wall-able; a victory of texture and colour over form and authentic reproduction. Great colours and enough tree detail to allow the brain to anchor its appreciation. I love that focal square too. Critical stuff: Can''t think of anything I would change. Overall: A fine semi-abstract.', '2012-01-01 10:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
