(6629899, 990162, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Lovely colors. My only critique is that I''d like to see it displayed in a larger size. When saving for web, I think it''s much better to move the slider to the left and sacrifice an unnoticeable amount of "quality" in order to end up with an image that is a full 800 pixels on its longest side. Of course that''s just speculation that that is the decision you were faced with here.<br/> <br/>It''s a great scene with great colors and amazing detail. If this doesn''t receive the high votes it deserves, it''s because it needs to be a bit bigger.</td>', 'Great photo. Lovely colors. My only critique is that I''d like to see it displayed in a larger size. When saving for web, I think it''s much better to move the slider to the left and sacrifice an unnoticeable amount of "quality" in order to end up with an image that is a full 800 pixels on its longest side. Of course that''s just speculation that that is the decision you were faced with here. It''s a great scene with great colors and amazing detail. If this doesn''t receive the high votes it deserves, it''s because it needs to be a bit bigger.', '2012-01-01 10:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6629900, 989911, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lovely muted feel and wonderful tones. I like how the vignette treatment mimics the circular pattern of the subject. Cool photo.</td>', 'Lovely muted feel and wonderful tones. I like how the vignette treatment mimics the circular pattern of the subject. Cool photo.', '2012-01-01 11:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
