(6629904, 986881, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great industrial scene. Love the tones as they move from the deep dark grey of the upper clouds down to the steam from the stacks. Cool photo.</td>', 'Great industrial scene. Love the tones as they move from the deep dark grey of the upper clouds down to the steam from the stacks. Cool photo.', '2012-01-01 11:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
