(6630404, 990589, 140305, '<td valign="top">This is really pretty.....I like how you used the tree to frame the scene. The only nit picky thing I can say is I wonder how different this would have looked if the roof tops on the red sheds were in the sun rather than the shade? It seems like my eye wants to see them more lit, but that''s just me. Nice photo.</td>', 'This is really pretty.....I like how you used the tree to frame the scene. The only nit picky thing I can say is I wonder how different this would have looked if the roof tops on the red sheds were in the sun rather than the shade? It seems like my eye wants to see them more lit, but that''s just me. Nice photo.', '2012-01-01 17:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
