(6630873, 988566, 124815, '<td valign="top">Now this title confuses me a little. For my feeling was that in this blizzard there is a shack protected from the cold where little people eat French fries and tell sad stories. A dreamy image for sure. <br/>bump</td>', 'Now this title confuses me a little. For my feeling was that in this blizzard there is a shack protected from the cold where little people eat French fries and tell sad stories. A dreamy image for sure. bump', '2012-01-01 22:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6630874, 990541, 102315, '<td valign="top">I quite like this image but there is just something missing that I just can''t put my finger on. It pops. The contrasting colors compliment each other well (from red to blue to white to black). All bright primary colors. I think it''s the flower pot that seems out of place. Everything in the image pops and the pot is a drab brown and draws my eyes to it wondering why it is there. 6 from me. Probably 8 without the pot. Hope I''m not being to picky just trying to work through why I thought this was a 6 image.</td>', 'I quite like this image but there is just something missing that I just can''t put my finger on. It pops. The contrasting colors compliment each other well (from red to blue to white to black). All bright primary colors. I think it''s the flower pot that seems out of place. Everything in the image pops and the pot is a drab brown and draws my eyes to it wondering why it is there. 6 from me. Probably 8 without the pot. Hope I''m not being to picky just trying to work through why I thought this was a 6 image.', '2012-01-01 22:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6630876, 990220, 67152, '<td valign="top">it only prevents those who don''t want to cross...<br/> <br/>i would recommend a quick clean on the sensor</td>', 'it only prevents those who don''t want to cross... i would recommend a quick clean on the sensor', '2012-01-01 22:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6630878, 990405, 102315, '<td valign="top">This image has great potential except for the blown out finger and the extreme shadows on the wall. Good focus on the hand with a slight OOF on the persons face and body. I would experiment with some lighting setups and try this one again. Try to accomplish a more even lighting across the entire image.<br/></td>', 'This image has great potential except for the blown out finger and the extreme shadows on the wall. Good focus on the hand with a slight OOF on the persons face and body. I would experiment with some lighting setups and try this one again. Try to accomplish a more even lighting across the entire image.', '2012-01-01 22:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
