(6633111, 990613, 141319, '<td valign="top">Something I always wanted to see :-). Great composition. Wonderful cloud formation and I like the focus on the forground with the froth of the sea. the thing I don''t like so much is the streaky mountain/rock. I assume its sun rays, but it looks odd to me.</td>', 'Something I always wanted to see :-). Great composition. Wonderful cloud formation and I like the focus on the forground with the froth of the sea. the thing I don''t like so much is the streaky mountain/rock. I assume its sun rays, but it looks odd to me.', '2012-01-03 15:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633116, 989865, 141319, '<td valign="top">This is a calendar picture :-) Beautiful colours to set everything off. great focus and DOF, really "sharp". lovely</td>', 'This is a calendar picture :-) Beautiful colours to set everything off. great focus and DOF, really "sharp". lovely', '2012-01-03 15:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633119, 989844, 115307, '<td valign="top">Sometimes rules are there to be broken. But in this case, I really think that the traditional Rule of Thirds (with the horizon being on the top thirds line) would have given this picture more of an edge than the current centered composition does. Its a very pretty landscape and I love the reflections, I just feel it could be even better with a more compelling composition. 6</td>', 'Sometimes rules are there to be broken. But in this case, I really think that the traditional Rule of Thirds (with the horizon being on the top thirds line) would have given this picture more of an edge than the current centered composition does. Its a very pretty landscape and I love the reflections, I just feel it could be even better with a more compelling composition. 6', '2012-01-03 15:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633121, 990484, 115307, '<td valign="top">Lovely. I love the way the sun hits the moss on that rock. I probably would have opted for a slightly lower perspective in order to bring more emphasis to that.</td>', 'Lovely. I love the way the sun hits the moss on that rock. I probably would have opted for a slightly lower perspective in order to bring more emphasis to that.', '2012-01-03 15:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633122, 989802, 115307, '<td valign="top">Oh my! I love the light here. This is a fantastic landscape picture, especially because it depicts something that is rarely seen in photographs (or at least not well since its usually to dark). Fantastic job!</td>', 'Oh my! I love the light here. This is a fantastic landscape picture, especially because it depicts something that is rarely seen in photographs (or at least not well since its usually to dark). Fantastic job!', '2012-01-03 15:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633123, 990625, 115307, '<td valign="top">Great capture of movement! 7</td>', 'Great capture of movement! 7', '2012-01-03 15:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633124, 989903, 115307, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great capture. I love the symmetry.<br/>I wish the background wasn''t so cluttered though. It distracts a LOT from the awesome dolphins. I would have used a much wider apeture. You could have also reduced the distraction in this image in photoshop by burning and blurring just the background. That would have been legal in advanced editing.</td>', 'Wow, what a great capture. I love the symmetry.I wish the background wasn''t so cluttered though. It distracts a LOT from the awesome dolphins. I would have used a much wider apeture. You could have also reduced the distraction in this image in photoshop by burning and blurring just the background. That would have been legal in advanced editing.', '2012-01-03 15:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633125, 990322, 115307, '<td valign="top">Great use of HDR, it really adds to the mood and ''age'' of the photograph. 7</td>', 'Great use of HDR, it really adds to the mood and ''age'' of the photograph. 7', '2012-01-03 15:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633126, 989155, 115307, '<td valign="top">Cute portrait and cute expression. I would like to see a tiny more sharpness in the eyes.</td>', 'Cute portrait and cute expression. I would like to see a tiny more sharpness in the eyes.', '2012-01-03 15:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633129, 989128, 115307, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this portrait, but your model looks really awkward with her head turned that way. It doesn''t look natural. I like the blue editing of the background, and the natural vignetting on the sides.</td>', 'I like the idea of this portrait, but your model looks really awkward with her head turned that way. It doesn''t look natural. I like the blue editing of the background, and the natural vignetting on the sides.', '2012-01-03 15:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633135, 987108, 115307, '<td valign="top">Great fashion portrait! I like how her gloves, hat and tattoo coordinate, and also like her expression and hair.<br/>A few things to improve though (IMO). You can just barely see what looks to be a bellybutton piercing, and its rather distracting. I would have cropped that out. Second, I would have blurred the skin of your model on the darker side of her face. The lighting makes it look like its either super noisy or she has uneven skin. A simple blurring would have rectified that. But anyways, great picture! 7</td>', 'Great fashion portrait! I like how her gloves, hat and tattoo coordinate, and also like her expression and hair.A few things to improve though (IMO). You can just barely see what looks to be a bellybutton piercing, and its rather distracting. I would have cropped that out. Second, I would have blurred the skin of your model on the darker side of her face. The lighting makes it look like its either super noisy or she has uneven skin. A simple blurring would have rectified that. But anyways, great picture! 7', '2012-01-03 16:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
