(6633425, 989671, 48389, '<td valign="top">This has to be my favourite in this challenge, absolutely amazing. I am not a huge fan of this type of photography but for some reason I feel I am being drawn into this shot and my imagination runs away with what this scene would actually look like if I was standing in it - does that make any sense?! I can''t wait till voting is over, fingers crossed you put this one up for sale! :-)</td>', 'This has to be my favourite in this challenge, absolutely amazing. I am not a huge fan of this type of photography but for some reason I feel I am being drawn into this shot and my imagination runs away with what this scene would actually look like if I was standing in it - does that make any sense?! I can''t wait till voting is over, fingers crossed you put this one up for sale! :-)', '2012-01-03 19:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
