(6635339, 989813, 104230, '<td valign="top">I like how the double row of nail heads along the arms of the chair echo the necklaces, and the polka dot top adds to that theme. The lighting is good, catching all those elements, and her hair and skirt as well.  But why is she wearing so many necklaces? with even more in the box. She doesn''t appear to be trying them on since how can you tell how one looks individually while wearing the others at the same time. Certainly intriguing..</td>', 'I like how the double row of nail heads along the arms of the chair echo the necklaces, and the polka dot top adds to that theme. The lighting is good, catching all those elements, and her hair and skirt as well.  But why is she wearing so many necklaces? with even more in the box. She doesn''t appear to be trying them on since how can you tell how one looks individually while wearing the others at the same time. Certainly intriguing..', '2012-01-04 23:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6635341, 990648, 104230, '<td valign="top">This is really special. A delight to look at.  Delicious textures, rich colors, wonderful tones. Very well processed. A rare 10.</td>', 'This is really special. A delight to look at.  Delicious textures, rich colors, wonderful tones. Very well processed. A rare 10.', '2012-01-04 23:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
