(6635409, 988928, 32011, '<td valign="top">I don''t often verbalise/vocalise my thoughts when voting, however, when this image came up I actually said, out-load, "WOW!"  This is an absolutely amazing image.  Tones, details, composition... all spectacular!  Congratulations on an outstanding Free Study entry... will, without a doubt, do very well.</td>', 'I don''t often verbalise/vocalise my thoughts when voting, however, when this image came up I actually said, out-load, "WOW!"  This is an absolutely amazing image.  Tones, details, composition... all spectacular!  Congratulations on an outstanding Free Study entry... will, without a doubt, do very well.', '2012-01-05 01:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
