(6635683, 989402, 104230, '<td valign="top">I especially like how the light glances off the scar by his eye. It really adds to the story told here. Good tones.</td>', 'I especially like how the light glances off the scar by his eye. It really adds to the story told here. Good tones.', '2012-01-05 11:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
