(6635698, 990329, 104230, '<td valign="top">An interesting series of lines and shapes here and a fine picture but for my eyes it feels a bit too static. I wonder if added texture from a slightly shorter exposure time would have spiced it up a bit, and kept my interest for longer. I like the colors from whatever is growing on the rock at the top near the waterfall.</td>', 'An interesting series of lines and shapes here and a fine picture but for my eyes it feels a bit too static. I wonder if added texture from a slightly shorter exposure time would have spiced it up a bit, and kept my interest for longer. I like the colors from whatever is growing on the rock at the top near the waterfall.', '2012-01-05 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6635707, 989765, 59029, '<td valign="top">hmm I see a scowling dude''s face, a raised hand, the hilt of something...then nothing.  If there''s a sword there, its blade has to be visible for this image to work.</td>', 'hmm I see a scowling dude''s face, a raised hand, the hilt of something...then nothing.  If there''s a sword there, its blade has to be visible for this image to work.', '2012-01-05 12:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
