(6637695, 990516, 94265, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this will be in the top 10. Lovely golden colours, nice exposure on the snow; I like the little detail of the fish, makes it a wee bit different to the typical shots that are usually just of the landscape.</td>', 'I have a feeling this will be in the top 10. Lovely golden colours, nice exposure on the snow; I like the little detail of the fish, makes it a wee bit different to the typical shots that are usually just of the landscape.', '2012-01-07 13:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637697, 989128, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love the setting and the blue tones, a bit quirky, a very cool modelling shot. My only gripe would be the crop, cutting off the bottom half of her legs/feet. I think composition-wise, this would have been improved if she was lounging or crouching in the corner instead. Still an awesome shot though.</td>', 'I love the setting and the blue tones, a bit quirky, a very cool modelling shot. My only gripe would be the crop, cutting off the bottom half of her legs/feet. I think composition-wise, this would have been improved if she was lounging or crouching in the corner instead. Still an awesome shot though.', '2012-01-07 13:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637701, 990220, 38162, '<td valign="top">sad</td>', 'sad', '2012-01-07 13:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
