(6637709, 990406, 94265, '<td valign="top">The image looks like it''s suffered some compression though, or perhaps overly-strong sharpening without denoising first? Particularly noticeable on the coach''s arm. Shame, spoils it for me; I like the composition though.</td>', 'The image looks like it''s suffered some compression though, or perhaps overly-strong sharpening without denoising first? Particularly noticeable on the coach''s arm. Shame, spoils it for me; I like the composition though.', '2012-01-07 13:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
