(6637786, 990234, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is so dark, the light is so gentle, even minimal. It could be a detail from a Renaissance painting.  Red orchids are unusual. They show up well against that dark emerald BG. I don''t know why you left all the noise in, but it works for me kind of like extra humidity in the air &amp; makes them even more exotic. Good job! Please accept this Gilded Lily along with my admiration for a beautiful photograph.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=981180" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981180.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981180.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981180.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is so dark, the light is so gentle, even minimal. It could be a detail from a Renaissance painting.  Red orchids are unusual. They show up well against that dark emerald BG. I don''t know why you left all the noise in, but it works for me kind of like extra humidity in the air & makes them even more exotic. Good job! Please accept this Gilded Lily along with my admiration for a beautiful photograph.', '2012-01-07 15:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637789, 990178, 63218, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I can''t tell for sure what flower this is &amp; I don''t care because I am lost in admiration of the emotional impact. The heat in the molten-lava colors creates a lovely contrast with the cool dewey lavenders. The blur creates its own detail. This is like an illustration of what a flower smells like.  Please accept this Gilded Lily &amp; my enthusiastic admiration for this excellent photograph.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=981203" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981203.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981203.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981203.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-01-08 00:31:56.</i></td>', 'Excellent! I can''t tell for sure what flower this is & I don''t care because I am lost in admiration of the emotional impact. The heat in the molten-lava colors creates a lovely contrast with the cool dewey lavenders. The blur creates its own detail. This is like an illustration of what a flower smells like.  Please accept this Gilded Lily & my enthusiastic admiration for this excellent photograph.', '2012-01-07 15:12:28.000000', '2012-01-08 00:31:56.000000', 1),
(6637793, 989652, 108580, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot. Works in B&amp;W due breath and BG. WD.</td>', 'Stunning shot. Works in B&W due breath and BG. WD.', '2012-01-07 15:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
