(6637820, 986521, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure I understand this, which is a rare bonus in this undemanding company. It''s at once literal and figurative, or maybe I mean representational and abstract.  It''s a bit anthropomorphic, from some angles.  And it''s quite cattish as well, in places.  Plus the light''s very nice.  Overall, it''s like an old pullover: the appeal doesn''t have to be rationalized.  Thank Goodness for that!  And thank you for the picture, for which I confer a shiny new Order of the Thumb.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I''m not entirely sure I understand this, which is a rare bonus in this undemanding company. It''s at once literal and figurative, or maybe I mean representational and abstract.  It''s a bit anthropomorphic, from some angles.  And it''s quite cattish as well, in places.  Plus the light''s very nice.  Overall, it''s like an old pullover: the appeal doesn''t have to be rationalized.  Thank Goodness for that!  And thank you for the picture, for which I confer a shiny new Order of the Thumb.', '2012-01-07 16:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637826, 988890, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Made me think of Billy Connolly''s self-descriptive, tongue-in-cheek phrase ''windswept and interesting''.</td>', 'Nice shot. Made me think of Billy Connolly''s self-descriptive, tongue-in-cheek phrase ''windswept and interesting''.', '2012-01-07 16:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
