(6638492, 990178, 141319, '<td valign="top">I think this is stunning and I am sorry you didn''t do faaaar better with it in the voting. We grow orchids and I am constantly looking for new ways to photograph them - this is a beautiful portrait of their "essence". It was also the inspiration for my "DOF in Red" challenge entry - I didn''t use an orchid and in the end it looks very different, but this photograph was the inspiration for it - Thank You :-)</td>', 'I think this is stunning and I am sorry you didn''t do faaaar better with it in the voting. We grow orchids and I am constantly looking for new ways to photograph them - this is a beautiful portrait of their "essence". It was also the inspiration for my "DOF in Red" challenge entry - I didn''t use an orchid and in the end it looks very different, but this photograph was the inspiration for it - Thank You :-)', '2012-01-08 01:59:35.000000', NULL, 0),
