(6638568, 990467, 141542, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> If it were my theatre I would hang this photo there.<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg"/> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree with posthumous...this is a great shot and I believe it was pretty harshly underappreciated.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: If it were my theatre I would hang this photo there. I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery.    I agree with posthumous...this is a great shot and I believe it was pretty harshly underappreciated.', '2012-01-08 06:15:12.000000', NULL, 0),
