(6638739, 990569, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think that when I go to the beach, one of my fave things to see is the light bouncing off of the water like this.  I believe that many of us think of diamonds when we see it.  The tilt didn''t work for me, I liked the vignette, and of course, the diamonds are beautiful!</td>', 'I think that when I go to the beach, one of my fave things to see is the light bouncing off of the water like this.  I believe that many of us think of diamonds when we see it.  The tilt didn''t work for me, I liked the vignette, and of course, the diamonds are beautiful!', '2012-01-08 10:44:36.000000', NULL, 0),
