(6638743, 990261, 104230, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image John. Congrats of the top 20 finish. Great sense of stillness and a beautiful capture of light.  I think the fish tackle box adds a great deal, by providing a third plane on interest in between the man and the row of stone "capping" (if that''s the right word).  So your eye does a hop, skip, and jump from the wall, to the box, then to the man!</td>', 'Wonderful image John. Congrats of the top 20 finish. Great sense of stillness and a beautiful capture of light.  I think the fish tackle box adds a great deal, by providing a third plane on interest in between the man and the row of stone "capping" (if that''s the right word).  So your eye does a hop, skip, and jump from the wall, to the box, then to the man!', '2012-01-08 10:49:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6638749, 990225, 67697, '<td valign="top">I liked the leading lines as well.  That spot of light in the middle also enhanced the mystery of the unknown tunnel.  Nice!</td>', 'I liked the leading lines as well.  That spot of light in the middle also enhanced the mystery of the unknown tunnel.  Nice!', '2012-01-08 10:56:22.000000', NULL, 0),
