(6639722, 989544, 124190, '<td valign="top">I came back to this again.....it really is a shot that makes me feel hopeful and positive!  (I also have to correct my spelling mistake.....I meant not, not no....lol) It holds my attention for a long time and I''m thinking you had already gotten out of bed because of the angle of your shot? Unless you sleep with your camera..hahah.....so you had already jumped out of bed after probably having opened your eyes to the possibilities of your GOOD morning! seeing things right away!!!  I love that! Where is your window.....in the city, the suburbs, the country?  I am still listening....but maybe the window is shut. And is certainly is NOT lacking ANYTHING!!!!!!!  anyway....... Have a great morning and Happy New Year!</td>', 'I came back to this again.....it really is a shot that makes me feel hopeful and positive!  (I also have to correct my spelling mistake.....I meant not, not no....lol) It holds my attention for a long time and I''m thinking you had already gotten out of bed because of the angle of your shot? Unless you sleep with your camera..hahah.....so you had already jumped out of bed after probably having opened your eyes to the possibilities of your GOOD morning! seeing things right away!!!  I love that! Where is your window.....in the city, the suburbs, the country?  I am still listening....but maybe the window is shut. And is certainly is NOT lacking ANYTHING!!!!!!!  anyway....... Have a great morning and Happy New Year!', '2012-01-09 08:24:21.000000', NULL, 0),
